# MiviaLab Business Context

When writing copy, CTAs, portfolio content, pricing language, or any user-facing material, read `assets/docs/mivialab-business.md` first and follow it.

## Quick reference

- **What:** Ottawa–Toronto web design & development studio for small businesses; branding/graphic design; possible digital marketing later.
- **Site goal:** Build trust → one primary contact action (short form; WeChat QR secondary). Other channels stay subordinate.
- **Positioning:** English-first Canadian studio — not a "Chinese niche" brand. Bilingual (EN/FR/中文) is a premium capability. Community network is the GTM wedge, not the public identity.
- **Differentiators (buyer language):** fast loads, security, full custom code (not templates), full-service so owners never touch the site.
- **Pricing:** Monthly subscription for maintenance, security, customization, SEO; new features/pages quoted separately.
- **Portfolio:** Meng Wei Yue Opera Studio = real client. Sample sites must be labeled as concepts, never fake clients.

For full strategy, open questions, target verticals, and proof requirements, use `assets/docs/mivialab-business.md`.
